WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.030
In the last years of Eastern Han, the farmers in the fields worked hard, but the harvests were meager and life was very hard.

00:00:07.330 --> 00:00:15.810
There was a man named Zhang Jiao; he led the followers of the Way of Great Peace, preaching everywhere, and many people came to hear him.

00:00:16.110 --> 00:00:21.990
His followers tied yellow cloths around their heads — this was the famous 'Yellow Turban.'

00:00:22.290 --> 00:00:30.620
In the year 184, the people wearing yellow turbans raised their banners and marched forward together — a mighty spectacle.

00:00:30.920 --> 00:00:36.270
When the officials at court heard the news, every one of them looked worried and had no idea what to do.

00:00:36.570 --> 00:00:42.980
Powerful leaders everywhere also began gathering their own armies, and the land grew more and more chaotic.

00:00:43.280 --> 00:00:50.000
The sun went down; Han's strength grew weaker and weaker, and the land gradually split into many parts.

